Aim: Demonstrate a final method that cannot be overridden.

Algorithm: Start
define parent class final method
call through child object
stop.

Program:

class Parent {
    final void show() { System.out.println("Final method"); }
}
class Child extends Parent { }
class FinalMethodDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) { new Child().show(); }
}

Result: Final method
